---@field semantics? gcp.cloudresourcemanager_v3.StringMap Map of resource semantics (e.g., `"ENVIRONMENT": "PRODUCTION"`).

---@class gcp.cloudresourcemanager_v3.FetchResourceSemanticsV3Request
