---@field parent? string A reference to the resource this Lien is attached to. The server will validate the parent against those for which Liens are supported. Example: `projects/1234`
---@field createTime? string The creation time of this Lien.
---@field name? string A system-generated unique identifier for this Lien. Example: `liens/1234abcd`
---@field reason? string Concise user-visible strings indicating why an action cannot be performed on a resource. Maximum length of 200 characters. Example: 'Holds production API key'
---@field origin? string A stable, user-visible/meaningful string identifying the origin of the Lien, intended to be inspected programmatically. Maximum length of 200 characters. Example: 'compute.googleapis.com'

