---@field parent? string Immutable. The resource name of the TagKey's parent. A TagKey can be parented by an Organization or a Project. For a TagKey parented by an Organization, its parent must be in the form `organizations/{org_id}`. For a TagKey parented by a Project, its parent can be in the form `projects/{project_id}` or `projects/{project_number}`.
